{"id": "t159-004", "text": "Kasia and Karan got engaged!! He asked on the beach in Gdansk. No date yet but they're saying summer 2027. Kasia wants a tiny wedding, Karan's mum wants 200 people. Kasia's brother Ivan is already lobbying to DJ. Congratulate them properly when I see them Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "summer 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants 200 people", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Congratulate them properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see them Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-007", "text": "Anika and Isaac called it off. Wedding was meant to be 14 August 2027 but it's not happening. She's moved back in with her parents in Reading for now. Isaac has kept the dog, Biscuit. She says she's fine but cried twice over coffee. Need to ring her this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "called it off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 August 2027"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog, Biscuit", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-010", "text": "Caught up with Agnieszka (Aga) at the school gates. Her sister Zara is getting married in Krakow on 21 June 2027, whole family flying out the week before. Aga is doing the speech and is terrified. Her kids are flower girls. Zara's fiancé is Polish too, they met at the hen do of a mutual friend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aga", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Krakow", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21 June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aga", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flower girls", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Polish", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t159-011", "text": "Asha didn't get the job at the museum. They gave it to an internal candidate. She was gutted but says she's applying for the archivist role at the uni instead, deadline 30 October. Don't forget to send her that contact at the library.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the museum", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "archivist role at the uni", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that contact at the library", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t159-012", "text": "Ignacio and Luis have their first anniversary on Saturday. Luis is planning a surprise dinner and asked me to keep Ignacio busy that afternoon. Ignacio mentioned wanting a proper espresso machine ages ago, could tell Luis.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep Ignacio busy", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a proper espresso machine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "ages ago"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell Luis", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t159-017", "text": "Kemal proposed to Matilda at her parents' anniversary party, which was apparently a bit of a scene. Her dad gave a speech afterwards anyway. They're thinking a registry office in spring 2027.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "registry office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in spring 2027", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t159-022", "text": "Rin passed her probation at the agency, permanent from 1 December 2026. She's buying a bike to celebrate. Her flatmate Khadija is moving out in the new year so she's flat hunting too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "permanent", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 1 December 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat hunting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t159-023", "text": "Wedding planning update from Ryan. Venue booked for 5 September 2027 at a barn near Hebden Bridge. Stag do probably the month before. He wants me as an usher. Isabel's sister Esme is maid of honour.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Stag do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the month before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t159-025", "text": "Karan has three interviews next week, Tues Wed and Fri. He's quite relaxed, seems to think the Friday one is the real contender. Ask him on the weekend which one he wants.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "three interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wed", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him on the weekend which one he wants", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-027", "text": "Note to self: CV needs updating before the Barros application closes on 15 November. Mention the project at Kumar & Co.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "CV needs updating", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Barros application", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Mention the project at Kumar & Co", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t159-029", "text": "Caitlin's last day at the solicitors is Friday, she's going freelance. Drinks after work at the Ivy, I said I'd go. Her boss Mrs Williams is apparently furious.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the solicitors", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Williams", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t159-030", "text": "Anika is doing much better. She's started a pottery course on Wednesdays and is thinking of applying for jobs in Bristol. Still not talking to Isaac.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing much better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of applying for jobs in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not talking to", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t159-034", "text": "Esme's dog Rolo has to have a lump removed on Thursday. She's in bits about it. Text her that afternoon to see how he got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lump removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-036", "text": "Ignacio is up for promotion to senior designer, decision by the end of November. Panel interview the Tuesday before. He's been working on his portfolio every evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion to senior designer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Panel interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Tuesday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t159-038", "text": "Isabel and Ryan's anniversary dinner got cancelled, Ryan's got Covid. Rebooking for December sometime. Isabel is fine, just annoyed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Covid", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rebooking", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December sometime", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "just annoyed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t159-039", "text": "Agnieszka's interview went badly. She blanked on the competency questions. They're interviewing others until 31 October so she'll hear after that. Ask her about it first week of November.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until 31 October"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after that"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "first week of November", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-041", "text": "Kemal's grandmother died in Izmir last week. He flew out on Friday, back on the 30th. Matilda stayed here with the kids. I should check on Matilda, she's on her own with three of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flew out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check on Matilda", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t159-044", "text": "Efua and Ivan's twins are getting christened on 22 November. Party at their house straight after. Efua says no gifts but they always say that, could get the twins something small.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting christened", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "straight after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "no gifts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the twins something small", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t159-045", "text": "Had a walk with Matilda. She's started the application for the PhD at Edinburgh, starts September 2027 if she gets in. Interview would be in February. Kemal is very supportive, he'd move up with her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD at Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "supportive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t159-046", "text": "Nasser and Isaac fell out over Isaac's wedding. Nasser wasn't asked to be best man, Isaac's brother Ivan got it instead. Wedding's 3 July 2027. Nasser says he's still going but won't do the stag. Ivan seemed embarrassed about the whole thing. Don't take sides.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fell out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 July 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "embarrassed", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t159-047", "text": "Caitlin's mum is retiring from nursing in March 2027 after forty years. Caitlin's planning a surprise party the weekend after. Her mum would love a garden voucher apparently. Remind me to ask Caitlin what I can bring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from nursing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "would love a garden voucher", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Caitlin what I can bring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t159-051", "text": "Shortlisted for the Popescu role! Phone interview on 29 October at 2pm. Need to read up on their supply chain stuff beforehand.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Shortlisted for the Popescu role", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Phone interview", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "29 October at 2pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "read up on their supply chain stuff", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t159-052", "text": "Fang's father's memorial is 15 December 2026 in Singapore. She's flying out with her brother the week before and staying through New Year. It's the first one since he passed. Should get her something for the trip.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "through New Year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her something for the trip", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t159-053", "text": "Lunch with Luis, Esme and Kasia. Luis had the second interview at the theatre yesterday and thinks he aced it, they'll call him by Friday. Esme's engaged now, to Graham's nephew Connor, no date. Kasia is still job hunting after the redundancy in August, has an interview at the library on 1 November. She seemed flat. Remind me to ask Luis on Friday if they called, and to text Kasia good luck the night before hers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the theatre", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nephew", "owner": "p7", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "owner": "p6", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job hunting", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the library", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 November", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Luis on Friday if they called", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p9", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Kasia good luck", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p10", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t159-059", "text": "Tidying up the spare room this weekend before mum comes on the 2nd.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Tidying up the spare room", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "comes", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t159-060", "text": "Agnieszka says Lukas is struggling at uni, first year, very homesick. He's coming home for reading week, 2 to 6 November. She'd like me to have a chat with him about jobs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "first year", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "reading week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 to 6 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "have a chat with him about jobs", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
